pace 1

## SQ-HH-304-site1 | rewritten: hops vines in two located forests (256 chunks each), sum at least 1, columns skipped 0
bootexpect Done \(
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> locate biome minecraft:forest
waitlog (is at \[|Could not find) 300
capture P is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> forceload add {P1-128} {P3-128} {P1+127} {P3+127}
sleep 90
> zhh2 countset {P1-128} 40 {P3-128} {P1+127} 120 {P3+127} hearthandharvest:hops_vine,farmersdelight:wild_carrots,minecraft:oak_log,minecraft:birch_log
waitlog \[zhh2\] countset columns skipped 900
look site 1 counts

## SQ-HH-304-site2 | second forest near 2144 -2592
> forceload remove all
> execute positioned 2144 70 -2592 run locate biome minecraft:forest
waitlog (is at \[|Could not find) 300
capture Q is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> forceload add {Q1-128} {Q3-128} {Q1+127} {Q3+127}
sleep 90
> zhh2 countset {Q1-128} 40 {Q3-128} {Q1+127} 120 {Q3+127} hearthandharvest:hops_vine,farmersdelight:wild_carrots,minecraft:oak_log,minecraft:birch_log
waitlog \[zhh2\] countset columns skipped 900
look sum of the two hops_vine counts at least 1; columns skipped 0 on each

